FavoriteSourcesController --> CreateFavoriteSourceCommandFromResourceAssembler : uses
FavoriteSourcesController --> NewsValueObjectFromStringAssembler : uses
FavoriteSourcesController --> ResponseEntityFromFavoriteSourceCommandResultAssembler : uses
FavoriteSourcesController --> ResponseEntityFromFavoriteSourceQueryResultAssembler : uses

FavoriteSourceCommandServiceImpl ..|> FavoriteSourceCommandService : implements
FavoriteSourceQueryServiceImpl ..|> FavoriteSourceQueryService : implements
FavoriteSourceCommandFailureDuplicate ..|> FavoriteSourceCommandFailure : implements
FavoriteSourceCommandService --> Result : returns
FavoriteSourceCommandService --> FavoriteSourceCommandFailure : returns
FavoriteSourceCommandServiceImpl --> FavoriteSourceRepository : uses
FavoriteSourceQueryServiceImpl --> FavoriteSourceRepository : uses
FavoriteSourceCommandServiceImpl --> FavoriteSource : creates
FavoriteSourceCommandServiceImpl --> Result : returns
FavoriteSourceCommandServiceImpl --> FavoriteSourceCommandFailure : returns
FavoriteSourceQueryService --> FavoriteSource : returns
FavoriteSourceQueryServiceImpl --> FavoriteSource : returns

' HTTP mapping
CreateFavoriteSourceCommandFromResourceAssembler ..> CreateFavoriteSourceResource : reads
CreateFavoriteSourceCommandFromResourceAssembler --> CreateFavoriteSourceCommand : creates
NewsValueObjectFromStringAssembler --> NewsApiKey : creates
NewsValueObjectFromStringAssembler --> SourceId : creates
ResponseEntityFromFavoriteSourceCommandResultAssembler --> Result : maps
ResponseEntityFromFavoriteSourceCommandResultAssembler --> FavoriteSourceCommandFailure : maps
ResponseEntityFromFavoriteSourceCommandResultAssembler --> FavoriteSourceResourceFromEntityAssembler : uses
ResponseEntityFromFavoriteSourceQueryResultAssembler --> FavoriteSourceResourceFromEntityAssembler : uses
FavoriteSourceResourceFromEntityAssembler ..> FavoriteSource : reads
FavoriteSourceResourceFromEntityAssembler --> FavoriteSourceResource : creates

' Domain model and persistence mapping
FavoriteSource --> CreateFavoriteSourceCommand : constructed from
FavoriteSource --> NewsApiKey : contains
FavoriteSource --> SourceId : contains
CreateFavoriteSourceCommand --> NewsApiKey : contains
CreateFavoriteSourceCommand --> SourceId : contains
GetAllFavoriteSourcesByNewsApiKeyQuery --> NewsApiKey : contains
GetFavoriteSourceByNewsApiKeyAndSourceIdQuery --> NewsApiKey : contains
GetFavoriteSourceByNewsApiKeyAndSourceIdQuery --> SourceId : contains
FavoriteSourceRepository --> FavoriteSource : persists
FavoriteSourceRepository --|> JpaRepository : extends
FavoriteSourceRepository --> NewsApiKey : queries by
FavoriteSourceRepository --> SourceId : queries by
