SourceIdAttributeConverter ..> SourceId : converts
Result ..> ResultSuccess : permits
Result ..> ResultFailure : permits

note bottom
  The REST controller delegates use cases to application services.
  Application implementations coordinate repository access and return
  domain aggregates or typed command failures. REST translators map
  those outcomes to HTTP resources and ProblemDetail responses.
  FavoriteSource enforces the unique (newsApiKey, sourceId) persistence constraint.
end note

@enduml
